      <p>If you live in London, the South East, East of England, Wales, or Northern Ireland and you're planning to move to Spain, this guide is written specifically for you. Since Brexit, UK citizens apply for the Non-Lucrative Visa as third-country nationals — the same category as US, Canadian, and Australian applicants. There is no EU fast-track route for British nationals anymore.</p>

