        <li>Your appointment confirmation email or reference number</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="msv__alert msv__alert--warn">
        <span class="msv__alert-icon">⚠️</span>
        <p><strong>Important:</strong> BLS staff will check that your dossier is complete before accepting it. If key documents are missing or incorrectly prepared (e.g., not apostilled, or translations not from a sworn translator), they may refuse to accept the application. This means rescheduling and further delays. Prepare thoroughly before attending.</p>
      </div>

      <h3 style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">After your BLS appointment:</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>You receive a receipt and tracking reference number</li>
        <li>BLS submits your dossier to the Spanish consulate</li>
        <li>You can check status via the BLS online portal</li>
        <li>Decision notification arrives by email (typically 8–14 weeks from submission)</li>
        <li>Return to BLS London to collect your passport with the stamped visa</li>
      </ul>

